invariant: INV-5
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_rsa_test
reason: ch_rsa_key_from_pem stops comparing the key's modulus with the
  end-entity certificate's, so a key file paired with the wrong chain
  decodes. The call's own signature then verifies under the key's
  modulus, and every client refuses the server's CertificateVerify.
  test_files passes the leaf of another key and a bare modulus.

--- old
             leaf_holds_rsa(leaf, leaf_len, key) && key_usable(cpu, key);
--- new
             key_usable(cpu, key);
    (void)leaf_holds_rsa;
